{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for and collect object if nearby. If not visible, search. Verify object. Store object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpItem    /> <Action ID = StoreItem    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsItem    /> <Condition ID = IsItemNearby    /> <Condition ID = IsItemVisible    /> <SubTree ID = InspectItem    /> <Action ID = SearchForItem    />\"",
